1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Some family tree’s refer to her as Fannie Bibi, which is incorrect, as they were not related (she was Yosef’s neighbor in Baghdad). Some also refer to her as Farha/Fannie Cohen, which might be the end of the Bakal 
2 CONC name (Bakal HaKohen, for example), as her death record in 1931 lists her father as David Cohen. Clement Soffer related that Reuben Bibi had told him that his grandmother was a Soffer, and, as we know, Yosef's mother's maiden name 
2 CONC was Nakash, so it would have to be Farha's mother that was a Soffer.
2 CONT As per family tradition, she is a direct descendant of King David.
