1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The SHM family tree has many incorrect family members in this family. For instance, it has Selim Gindi, the husband of Nizha (Shmalo), as a son of Jacob and Mazal, born in 1893, even though it has David Gindi, born
2 CONC  2 years earlier, as a child of the same parents. David's parents were really Jacob and SARAH/SARINA (born Antebi). It has many of the children of R' Jacob M. Gindi Dakneesh as the children of this Jacob Gindi Dakneesh, including 
2 CONC Eli Gindi, Nizha Shrem, Sarina Marcus, and Gamila Menaged. It also has the Ezra Gindi's mixed up, as Jacques was a son of Ezra J. A. Gindi, not Ezra J. M. Gindi.
