1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Many have their information incorrect and list Joseph Cohen & an unknown Esther as the parents of Sophie Maslaton, Linda Tebele, and Milo Nakash. However, this is incorrect. Sophie Maslaton, Rachel Braha, Adele Coh
2 CONC en (Paris), Milo Nakash, Joseph A. Cohen, and Linda Tebele were the children of Abraham & Esther (maiden name unknown, presumed Cohen) Cohen. Abraham was the eldest son of Joseph & Rachel (Sitt) Cohen. This can be proven from the 
2 CONC marriage records of Sophie Maslaton (parents Abraham & Esther Cohen), Rachel Braha (same parents as Sophie), and Linda Tebele (R’ Jacob Kassin’s Ketubah record). This would make Michel, Moise, Aaron, and the rest of the children o
2 CONC f Joseph & Rachel, the aunts and uncles to Sophie, Rachel, and the rest of their family.
