1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Rav Avraham Moshe Meyuhas (Wikipedia) One of the sages of Jerusalem. He was called the son of the first Samuel the first. In 1723 , a tyrannical ruler came to power, demanding that the community pay 91,000 divorces
2 CONC  within 91 days, and arrested Rabbi Moshe Meyuhas, who was one of the heads of the Sephardi Community Committee in Jerusalem , in order to pressure the community to raise the money. Grandson, Rafael attributed , went about Dr. to 
2 CONC Constantinople to extract the derivation community. His son Samuel married the daughter of the sage Rabbi Israel Yaakov Hagiz .[https://he.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D7%9E%D7%A9%D7%A4%D7%97%D7%AA_%D7%9E%D7%99%D7%95%D7%97%D7%A1#%D7%AA%D7%
2 CONC 95%D7%9C%D7%93%D7%95%D7%AA_%D7%94%D7%9E%D7%A9%D7%A4%D7%97%D7%94]
